# Kyoshi Warriors {3}{W}, 3/3: "When this creature enters, create a 1/1 white Ally creature token." The trigger is
# independent of its source once it is on the stack (CR 113.7a): Bot2 answers it by killing the Warriors with Lightning Bolt,
# and the Ally token is made for Bot1 all the same, under the trigger's controller (CR 111.2).

